+ * RV04 for current, RV03 for voltage). Configured at runtime via env vars:
+ *   A1_ATTACK=1            enable
+ *   A1_TARGET=present_current|present_voltage|both   (default present_current)
+ *   A1_FACTOR=1.10         multiplicative offset applied to the mantissa
+ * A pure message-value rewrite: no extra V2G messages are emitted, so message
+ * counts are unchanged (removes the additive-injection count confound).
+ */
